<li>Panjang: 24,77 m (81&amp;nbsp;ft 3 in)</li>
<li>Lebar sayap: 8.40 m (27&amp;nbsp;ft 7 in)</li>
<li>Berat kosong: 11.450&amp;nbsp;kg (£ 25.243)</li>
<li>Max berat lepas landas: 35.000&amp;nbsp;kg (£ 77.162)</li>
<li>Kapasitas bahan bakar: 16.600&amp;nbsp;kg</li>
<h3>Prestasi</h3>
<li>Kecepatan maksimum: 2.775&amp;nbsp;km / jam (1.724&amp;nbsp;mph, 1.498 kn)</li>
